# Korriban (K1, korr_m33aa Dreshdae, korr_m33ab the way to the academy,
# korr_m35aa the Sith academy, korr_m36aa the Valley of the Dark Lords,
# korr_m34aa the Shyrack cave, korr_m38ab Tulak Hord's tomb, korr_m39aa
# Naga Sadow's): into the academy, prestige with Master Uthar (the Code,
# the Mandalorian's cache, the runaway students, Lashowe's holocron, Jorak
# Uln's tablet), then the final test in Naga Sadow's tomb. Starts from the
# Leviathan route's checkpoint (the Ebon Hawk away, at Korriban):
#   kjk playthrough k1 @lev_escaped data/routes/k1/korriban.route --god
exit ebn12_ebonexit      # down the ramp: Dreshdae's landing pad
save korriban
to kor33_portauthor      # the port authority (the fee paid), the Sith
to kor33_shaardan        # bully, Lashowe's three: scenes on the way
to kor33_lashowe
exit kor33a_kor33b       # out to the academy's door
to kor33_mekel
use kor33_mekel
talk
use k33_academyguard     # no medallion, no entry
talk
save kor_guard
say sure you want to die # back in: the thugs (their leader's medallion)
exit kor33b_kor33a
to kor33_portauthor
fight 20
use k33b_sththuglead
fight 20
save kor_medallion
exit kor33a_kor33b
use k33_academyguard     # sent to Yuthura, in the cantina
talk
exit kor33b_kor33a
say [lie]                # ready to join the Sith: a lie
to kor33_yuthura
use kor33_yuthura
talk
talk                     # the academy: Uthar's welcome
save kor_academy
to k35_init_yuthura      # Yuthura outside your room: her plot, the Code
talk
save kor_yuthura
